abstract: >-
  sapiensOS is not software for machines; it is operating consciousness — a
  shared discipline of awareness, law, and self-rule run together by conscious
  humans over deterministic instruments. Constitutio Intermundia is its
  constitution between worlds, built to hold on Earth and beyond.
  Public Release v1.20.
